      "id": "claim_d929cf5c8d694f25b4c8d68b73b10a94",
      "statement": "`RepositoryMemory` is a repository-scoped facade that resolves its root path and coordinates indexing, persistent storage, an in-memory symbol graph, embeddings, a vector backend, hybrid retrieval, and high-level build/refresh/query/graph/context operations.",
